# Allowlist ceilings and the guards that enforce them (Phase 7 ratchet).
#
# This file only takes effect when branch protection on main enables "Require review from
# Code Owners" (and "Require a pull request before merging"). That setting lives in the GitHub
# repository settings and cannot be enabled from the repository content: a maintainer must
# turn it on. Until then these entries are documentation, and the CI step in
# .github/workflows/ci.yml (which runs the base revision's scripts/check_ceiling_review.py)
# is the only enforcement.
#
# python/test_allowlist_ceilings.py asserts that every ceiling file and every
# PROTECTED_PATHS entry of scripts/check_ceiling_review.py is listed here.

